[黝黑的音乐]

01:41.344 --> 01:43.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:43.068 --> 01:46.103
[babbling]
[胡说]

01:46.172 --> 01:47.379
[overlapping groans]
[重叠的呻吟声]

01:47.448 --> 01:50.068
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

01:50.137 --> 01:52.482
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

01:52.551 --> 01:55.000
[sniffing]
Ow!
[嗅嗅]
噢！

01:55.068 --> 01:57.379
[gagging]
[作呕]

01:57.448 --> 01:59.034
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

01:59.103 --> 02:02.241
[hollering]
[喊叫]

02:02.310 --> 02:05.034
Patrick, when was the last time
you took a bath?
帕特里克，最后一次是什么时候
你洗澡了吗？

02:05.103 --> 02:06.000
- Huh.
- 嗯。

02:06.068 --> 02:08.413
I can't think that far behind.
我不能认为落后那么远。

02:08.482 --> 02:11.758
- That is the smelliest smell
I have ever smelled.
- 那是最臭的味道
我曾经闻过。

02:11.827 --> 02:14.206
It's actually quite impressive.
这实际上是相当令人印象深刻的。

02:14.275 --> 02:15.689
- Why thank you!
- 为什么要谢谢你！

02:15.758 --> 02:18.000
- Do you, uh, mind if I take
- 你介意我接受吗

02:18.068 --> 02:22.000
another whiff?
- Take a crack at it.
另一种气味？
- 尝试一下。

02:24.172 --> 02:25.689
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

02:25.758 --> 02:29.379
[groaning]
[呻吟]

02:29.448 --> 02:32.206
[grunts]
- Uh, uh-huh.
[咕哝]
- 呃，嗯。

02:32.275 --> 02:35.655
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:35.724 --> 02:39.310
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

02:39.379 --> 02:40.827
Huh?
[sniffing]
啊？
[嗅嗅]

02:40.896 --> 02:43.448
[gags, sniffs]
[堵嘴，嗅嗅]

02:43.517 --> 02:45.655
Phew. Nope.
唷。没有。

02:45.724 --> 02:47.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:47.586 --> 02:49.413
[sniffs]
Nope.
[嗅嗅]
不。

02:49.482 --> 02:50.862
Hmm.
[sniffing]
唔。
[嗅嗅]

02:50.931 --> 02:52.965
- Hmm?
- [deep inhale]
- 唔？
- [深吸气]

02:53.034 --> 02:54.482
Nope.
没有。

02:54.551 --> 02:57.241
- Huh.
Can't please everyone.
- 嗯。
无法让所有人都满意。

02:57.310 --> 02:58.620
- Huh.
- 嗯。

02:58.689 --> 03:02.137
Huh?
What in Sulfur City?
啊？
硫磺城有什么？

03:02.206 --> 03:03.413
Ah-ha!
啊哈！

03:03.482 --> 03:06.482
[grunts]
- [screaming]
[咕哝]
- [尖叫]

03:06.551 --> 03:08.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:08.275 --> 03:12.206
- And don't come back until
you've cleaned up your act!
- 别回来直到
你已经洗清了你的行为！

03:12.275 --> 03:13.551
- Oh yeah?
- 哦是吗？

03:13.620 --> 03:17.137
Well, what if I don't
clean up my act, huh?
好吧，如果我不这样做怎么办？
清理我的行为吧？

03:17.206 --> 03:18.862
I'm revolting!
我要反抗！

03:18.931 --> 03:20.103
[flowers crackling]
[鲜花噼啪作响]

03:20.172 --> 03:22.862
[clears throat]
I proclaim
[清嗓子]
我宣告

03:22.931 --> 03:24.689
a declamation
声明

03:24.758 --> 03:26.965
of stink-dependence!
臭依赖！

03:27.034 --> 03:28.551
[trumpets tooting]
[喇叭声]

03:28.620 --> 03:29.965
Humph.
哼。

03:30.034 --> 03:33.172
[goofy music]
[愚蠢的音乐]

03:33.241 --> 03:35.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:35.068 --> 03:37.344
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

03:37.413 --> 03:40.275
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:40.344 --> 03:43.310
[laughing, hollering]
[大笑，大喊]

03:43.379 --> 03:48.310
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:48.379 --> 03:50.517
[all guffawing]
[全场大笑]

03:50.586 --> 03:56.482
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:56.551 --> 03:59.482
[laughing, babbling]
[大笑，胡言乱语]

03:59.551 --> 04:01.482
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:01.551 --> 04:03.517
[cheers]
[干杯]

04:03.586 --> 04:06.275
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

04:06.344 --> 04:09.137
[wheezes]
[喘息声]

04:09.206 --> 04:10.517
[gasps]
[喘气]

04:10.586 --> 04:12.448
Oh...
哦...

04:12.517 --> 04:14.137
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

04:14.206 --> 04:16.275
Ah...
啊...

04:16.344 --> 04:18.172
[angelic music]
[天使音乐]

04:18.241 --> 04:19.517
[laughing]
[笑]

04:19.586 --> 04:22.103
- The next..,
[coughing, gagging]
- 下一个..,
[咳嗽、作呕]

04:22.172 --> 04:23.827
The next morning.
第二天早上。

04:23.896 --> 04:26.827
[foreboding music]
[不祥的音乐]

04:26.896 --> 04:28.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:28.965 --> 04:31.344
[burbling]
[咕噜声]

04:31.413 --> 04:34.931
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:35.000 --> 04:37.206
[both gagging]
[两人都作呕]

04:37.275 --> 04:38.448
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:38.517 --> 04:40.965
- [gasps]
Oh, Neptune.
- [喘气]
哦，海王星。

04:41.034 --> 04:44.000
- Oh!
- I can't breathe!
- 哦！
- 我无法呼吸！

04:44.068 --> 04:45.724
Thank you, Mother.
谢谢你，妈妈。

04:45.793 --> 04:47.758
- Amazing.
- 惊人的。

04:47.827 --> 04:49.448
[camera shutter snaps]
[相机快门按下]

04:49.517 --> 04:50.448
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

04:50.517 --> 04:51.689
- Extra, extra!
- 额外，额外！

04:51.758 --> 04:53.827
Filthy Muck spotted in town!
镇上发现肮脏的粪便！

04:53.896 --> 04:55.344
Mysterious smelly figure
神秘臭人物

04:55.413 --> 04:59.034
terrorizes
Bikini Bottom's noses!
恐吓
比基尼泳裤的鼻子！

04:59.103 --> 05:02.517
- Jumpin' Jehoshaphat!
- 跳约沙法！

05:02.586 --> 05:03.827
[overlapping chatter]
[重叠的喋喋不休]

05:03.896 --> 05:06.344
- I don't--I don't watch
reality, though.
- 我不--我不看
但现实是。

05:06.413 --> 05:09.448
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

05:09.517 --> 05:12.551
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:12.620 --> 05:14.620
- Eh, Filthy Muck.
- 呃，肮脏的垃圾。

05:14.689 --> 05:16.655
You don't scare me.
你别吓我。

05:16.724 --> 05:19.379
I can't smell.
我闻不到。

05:19.448 --> 05:21.862
- [belches]
- [打嗝]

05:21.931 --> 05:23.896
- My nose ain't work
- 我的鼻子不行了

05:23.965 --> 05:27.482
since the great Sulfur War
of '09!
自伟大的硫磺战争以来
09 年！

05:27.551 --> 05:29.310
Humph!
哼!

05:29.379 --> 05:32.068
[hollers]
What are you looking at?
[喊叫]
你在看什么？

05:32.137 --> 05:34.413
[lighthearted music]
[轻松的音乐]

05:34.482 --> 05:36.275
- Oh, I know him!
- 哦，我认识他！

05:36.344 --> 05:37.655
It's Patrick.
是帕特里克。

05:37.724 --> 05:40.137
Filthy Muck is Patrick.
肮脏的泥巴是帕特里克。

05:40.206 --> 05:41.413
Oop.
哎呀。

05:41.482 --> 05:44.275
Oh, that poor repulsive pile
of sludge.
哦，那可怜的令人厌恶的一堆
污泥。

05:44.344 --> 05:46.862
All alone without a friend.
孤身一人，没有朋友。

05:46.931 --> 05:48.551
I gotta find him.
- [groans]
我必须找到他。
- [呻吟]

05:48.620 --> 05:50.517
- I gotta help him.
- 我得帮助他。

05:50.586 --> 05:52.482
I gotta love him.
我必须爱他。

05:52.551 --> 05:54.482
[sweeping crescendo]
[横扫渐强]

05:54.551 --> 05:57.103
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

05:57.172 --> 06:00.206
- [goofy exclamations]
- [愚蠢的感叹]

06:00.275 --> 06:02.068
Shablam.
沙布拉姆。

06:02.137 --> 06:04.000
[nose sniffing]
Ah!
[鼻子嗅]
啊！

06:04.068 --> 06:06.034
[nose barking]
Whoa!
[鼻子吠叫]
哇！

06:06.103 --> 06:08.172
[babbling]
- See?
[胡言乱语]
- 看到了吗？

06:08.241 --> 06:10.586
I told you this town
was pet-friendly.
我告诉过你这个小镇
宠物友好。

06:10.655 --> 06:13.310
- Walkies?
- 对讲机？

06:13.379 --> 06:14.689
- Oh, boy.
- 哦，男孩。

06:14.758 --> 06:16.724
[panting, barking]
[气喘吁吁，吠叫]

06:16.793 --> 06:19.068
[nose sniffing]
[鼻子嗅]

06:19.137 --> 06:21.931
[nose barking]
- [hollers]
[鼻子吠叫]
- [喊叫]

06:22.000 --> 06:24.206
[nose barking]
[鼻子吠叫]

06:24.275 --> 06:26.689
[treacherous music]
[奸诈的音乐]

06:26.758 --> 06:29.310
[sniffs, groans]
[嗅嗅，呻吟]

06:29.379 --> 06:31.137
Blegh.
布莱。

06:31.206 --> 06:33.000
Patrick, are you in there?
帕特里克，你在里面吗？

06:33.068 --> 06:36.103
- [laughing, babbling]
- [大笑，胡言乱语]

06:36.172 --> 06:39.413
Yummy.
- Oh, Patrick!
好吃。
- 哦，帕特里克！

06:39.482 --> 06:42.482
- [indistinct mumbling]
- [groans]
- [含糊不清的咕哝声]
- [呻吟]

06:42.551 --> 06:44.103
It's like you've got
a force-field
就好像你已经拥有了
力场

06:44.172 --> 06:45.482
of stink around you.
你周围的恶臭。

06:45.551 --> 06:47.655
I can't penetrate it.
我无法穿透它。

06:47.724 --> 06:49.689
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:49.758 --> 06:50.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:50.965 --> 06:53.103
Hmm.
Hey, maybe a little
唔。
嘿，也许有一点

06:53.172 --> 06:55.275
trash-stachio will neutralize
the smell
垃圾stachio将中和
气味

06:55.344 --> 06:56.827
and get my sniffer used to it.
让我的嗅探器习惯它。

06:56.896 --> 06:58.551
[sniffs]
Mm-hmm.
[嗅嗅]
嗯嗯。

06:58.620 --> 07:00.000
It's working.
它正在发挥作用。

07:00.068 --> 07:02.137
Should I call you "Patrick
or "Filthy Muck"?
我应该叫你“帕特里克?
还是“肮脏的粪土”？

07:02.206 --> 07:05.103
[laughs]
I'm gonna call you Filthy Muck.
[笑]
我会叫你肮脏的泥巴。

07:05.172 --> 07:06.551
[laughs]
- Mm-hmm.
[笑]
- 嗯嗯。

07:06.620 --> 07:08.517
- And you can call me
"Little Yuck."
- 你可以打电话给我
“小呸。”

07:08.586 --> 07:11.379
[both laughing[
[两人都笑了[

07:11.448 --> 07:13.034
- ♪ If you've ever smelled
the stink ♪
- ♪ 如果你闻过
恶臭♪

07:13.103 --> 07:14.620
♪ Of an unwashed dog ♪
♪ 一只没洗过澡的狗 ♪

07:14.689 --> 07:16.758
♪ Or inhaled the fumes
of a gassy bog ♪
♪ 或者吸入烟雾
充满气体的沼泽 ♪

07:16.827 --> 07:19.275
♪ If a whiff of rancid rubbish
makes your tonsils clench ♪
♪ 如果有一股腐臭的垃圾味
让你的扁桃体紧缩♪

07:19.344 --> 07:21.931
♪ Well, friend, that's just
a hint of Filthy Muck stench ♪
♪ 嗯，朋友，就是这样
一丝污秽的臭味♪

07:22.000 --> 07:23.793
♪ Filthy Muck ♪
- ♪ Filthy Muck ♪
♪ 肮脏的淤泥 ♪
- ♪ 肮脏的淤泥 ♪

07:23.862 --> 07:25.620
- ♪ Filthy Muck ♪
- ♪ Filthy Muck ♪
- ♪ 肮脏的淤泥 ♪
- ♪ 肮脏的淤泥 ♪

07:25.689 --> 07:27.172
♪ And his nauseating buddy
Little Yuck ♪
♪ 还有他令人作呕的伙伴
小呸呸♪

07:27.241 --> 07:28.758
- Pee-ew
- ♪ They roam with ♪
- 噗噗
- ♪ 他们与 ♪ 一起漫游

07:28.827 --> 07:30.793
♪ The sweaty socks
and musky boots ♪
♪ 出汗的袜子
还有麝香靴子♪

07:30.862 --> 07:32.793
♪ The frolic with the belches
and the putrid poots ♪
♪ 打嗝嬉闹
还有那些腐烂的粪便 ♪

07:32.862 --> 07:35.034
♪ Living by the code
of the stink-filled snoots ♪
♪ 遵守规范
充满臭味的束光筒♪

07:35.103 --> 07:37.517
♪ They love every aroma
just as long as it pollutes ♪
♪ 他们喜欢每一种香气
只要有污染就好了♪

07:37.586 --> 07:39.379
♪ Filthy Muck ♪
- ♪ Filthy Muck ♪
♪ 肮脏的淤泥 ♪
- ♪ 肮脏的淤泥 ♪

07:39.448 --> 07:41.275
- ♪ Filthy Muck ♪
- ♪ Filthy Muck ♪
- ♪ 肮脏的淤泥 ♪
- ♪ 肮脏的淤泥 ♪

07:41.344 --> 07:42.827
- ♪ There's no stink that ever
stank so rank ♪
- ♪ 从来没有臭味
太臭了♪

07:42.896 --> 07:44.551
♪ No stagnant mildew
half as dank ♪
♪ 无滞霉现象
一半潮湿♪

07:44.620 --> 07:46.000
♪ As the stinky stank
of Filthy Muck ♪
♪ 臭气熏天
肮脏的污泥♪

07:46.068 --> 07:48.068
♪ And his buddy Little Yuck ♪
♪ 还有他的好友小呸 ♪

07:48.137 --> 07:49.379
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

07:49.448 --> 07:51.413
- Extra, extra!
Read all about it!
- 额外，额外！
阅读所有关于它的内容！

07:51.482 --> 07:53.551
Filthy Muck finds playmate!
脏屎找到玩伴了！

07:53.620 --> 07:55.689
Noses on high alert!
鼻子处于高度戒备状态！

07:55.758 --> 07:57.103
[alarm blaring]
[警报声]

07:57.172 --> 07:58.793
- My schnozzola!
- 我的雪诺佐拉！

07:58.862 --> 08:01.275
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

08:01.344 --> 08:03.103
- People left
their food behind.
- 人离开了
他们的食物落后了。

08:03.172 --> 08:04.758
[both munching]
[两人都在咀嚼]

08:04.827 --> 08:06.965
Shouldn't go to waste.
不应该浪费。

08:07.034 --> 08:09.689
- I don't care how many
of you there are,
- 我不在乎有多少
你们当中有，

08:09.758 --> 08:11.413
you don't scare me!
你别吓我！

08:11.482 --> 08:13.034
I can't smell!
我闻不到！

08:13.103 --> 08:14.827
[hacking cough]
[干咳]

08:14.896 --> 08:18.275
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

08:18.344 --> 08:20.310
- Huh, people left
their instruments behind.
- 呃，人走了
他们的乐器落后了。

08:20.379 --> 08:22.103
Shouldn't go to waste.
不应该浪费。

08:22.172 --> 08:23.620
[radical rock music]
[激进摇滚乐]

08:23.689 --> 08:25.103
- Boo!
- 嘘！

08:25.172 --> 08:27.000
I can't smell,
我闻不到，

08:27.068 --> 08:28.931
but you two stink!
但你们两个太臭了！

08:29.000 --> 08:31.586
[laughing]
[笑]

08:31.655 --> 08:33.137
[wind blowing]
[风吹来]

08:33.206 --> 08:35.344
[upbeat calliope music]
[欢快的风琴音乐]

08:35.413 --> 08:38.482
[both shouting, laughing]
[两人大喊大笑]

08:38.551 --> 08:43.310
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:43.379 --> 08:46.931
- Wow, I never knew how great
smelling bad can be.
- 哇，我从来不知道有多棒
气味难闻还可以。

08:47.000 --> 08:49.034
There are no lines
for anything.
没有线条
对于任何事情。

08:49.103 --> 08:51.551
How you doing back there,
Old Man Jenkins?
你在那里过得怎么样，
老詹金斯？

08:51.620 --> 08:53.620
- I'm not--
- Yeah, we know.
-我不是--
- 是的，我们知道。

08:53.689 --> 08:56.034
"Not scared
'cause you can't smell."
“不害怕
因为你闻不到气味。”

08:56.103 --> 09:00.482
[laughs]
We love you, man.
[笑]
我们爱你，伙计。

09:00.551 --> 09:01.620
[sighs]
[叹气]

09:01.689 --> 09:03.275
Today was a beautiful day,
Patrick.
今天是美好的一天，
帕特里克.

09:03.344 --> 09:06.275
Oops, I mean Filthy Muck.
[laughs]
哎呀，我的意思是肮脏的淤泥。
[笑]

09:06.344 --> 09:08.068
Ah, just look
at the beautiful stars
啊，看看吧
在美丽的星星

09:08.137 --> 09:09.586
in the sky.
在天空中。

09:09.655 --> 09:12.103
And look at the stars
down there on the ground.
看看星星
就在地面上。

09:12.172 --> 09:13.275
Oh, they're not stars.
哦，他们不是明星。

09:13.344 --> 09:15.172
They're flames on sticks.
他们是棍棒上的火焰。

09:15.241 --> 09:16.689
Hi, everybody.
大家好。

09:16.758 --> 09:18.241
Whoop.
哎哟。

09:18.310 --> 09:21.137
We having a luau?
- Luau nothing!
我们有宴会吗？
- 卢奥没什么！

09:21.206 --> 09:23.586
We're running you
and your stinky friend
我们正在运行你
和你的臭朋友

09:23.655 --> 09:25.137
out of town!
出城了！

09:25.206 --> 09:27.344
[all shouting]
[大家大喊]

09:27.413 --> 09:29.379
- But it's me, SpongeBob!
- 但这是我，海绵宝宝！

09:29.448 --> 09:31.931
Bikini Bottom's favorite
fry cook?
比基尼泳裤的最爱
炒菜做饭？

09:32.000 --> 09:33.931
[all muttering]
[大家嘀咕]

09:34.000 --> 09:35.689
- All right, well,
you can stay
- 好吧，好吧，
你可以留下来

09:35.758 --> 09:37.137
if you clean up your act.
如果你改正自己的行为。

09:37.206 --> 09:40.103
But he's gotta go!
- No, please!
但他必须走！
- 不，拜托！

09:40.172 --> 09:42.620
I'll clean him up!
I promise!
我来收拾他！
我保证！

09:42.689 --> 09:45.448
[crowd shouting]
[人群喊叫]

09:45.517 --> 09:47.965
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:48.034 --> 09:49.827
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:49.896 --> 09:51.379
[water spraying]
[喷水]

09:51.448 --> 09:53.965
[panting]
Nope, still filthy.
[气喘吁吁]
不行，还是脏兮兮的。

09:54.034 --> 09:55.827
[babbles]
[胡言乱语]

09:55.896 --> 09:58.000
[water spraying]
[喷水]

09:58.068 --> 09:59.413
- Did you bring any matches?
- 你带火柴了吗？

09:59.482 --> 10:01.344
- Nah, I didn't bring
any matches.
- 不，我没带
任何比赛。

10:01.413 --> 10:04.517
- To the flame store!
[all hollering]
- 去火焰商店！
[大家大喊大叫]

10:04.586 --> 10:06.689
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

10:06.758 --> 10:09.137
- We couldn't get
the stain out.
- 我们没能得到
去除污渍。

10:09.206 --> 10:11.137
- Uh, thanks anyway.
- 呃，还是谢谢你。

10:11.206 --> 10:13.000
[all shouting]
[大家大喊]

10:13.068 --> 10:16.068
[shouting]
- [giggling]
[喊叫]
- [咯咯笑]

10:16.137 --> 10:17.482
Huh?
啊？

10:17.551 --> 10:19.965
No!
Patrick's my best friend!
不！
帕特里克是我最好的朋友！

10:20.034 --> 10:22.241
Please, put down your torches
请放下你的火把

10:22.310 --> 10:24.275
and pick up mops and soap!
并拿起拖把和肥皂！

10:24.344 --> 10:26.000
We can clean him.
我们可以清理他。

10:26.068 --> 10:28.137
That would solve everything.
这样就解决了一切。

10:28.206 --> 10:31.758
- Can I rub real hard
to express my anger?
- 我可以用力擦吗
来表达我的愤怒？

10:31.827 --> 10:34.620
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

10:34.689 --> 10:36.068
- Yeah, I guess so.
- 是的，我想是的。

10:36.137 --> 10:38.206
- [growls]
Good!
- [咆哮]
好！

10:38.275 --> 10:40.103
all: Yeah!
全体：是啊！

10:40.172 --> 10:41.724
[lighthearted music]
[轻松的音乐]

10:41.793 --> 10:44.724
[all chattering]
[大家都在喋喋不休]

10:44.793 --> 10:46.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:46.448 --> 10:49.068
[all gasp]
- Where'd he go?
[全都喘气]
- 他去哪儿了？

10:49.137 --> 10:50.758
There's nothing there.
那里什么也没有。

10:50.827 --> 10:52.241
He was the muck.
他就是一坨屎。

10:52.310 --> 10:54.413
Oh, Patrick.
哦，帕特里克。

10:54.482 --> 10:56.482
- That's my name.
- Huh?
- 那是我的名字。
- 啊？

10:56.551 --> 10:58.344
Ooh!
- At least, I think
哦！
- 至少我认为

10:58.413 --> 11:00.344
it's my name.
- That wasn't you
这是我的名字。
- 那不是你

11:00.413 --> 11:02.068
under all that muck?
在那些淤泥下面？

11:02.137 --> 11:03.655
- Uh, I don't think so.
- 呃，我不这么认为。

11:03.724 --> 11:06.724
I went home and took a bath
after I realized
我回家洗了个澡
当我意识到之后

11:06.793 --> 11:10.275
that I'd never be allowed
in the Krusty Krab again.
我永远不会被允许
再次进入蟹堡王。

11:10.344 --> 11:11.931
- But if that was--
then who was--
- 但如果那是--
那么谁是——

11:12.000 --> 11:13.931
- [hollers]
- [喊叫]

11:14.000 --> 11:15.965
Now I'm scared!
现在我很害怕！

11:16.034 --> 11:18.448
I'm really scared!
我真的很害怕！

11:18.517 --> 11:20.758
[whimpers]
I can't take it!
[呜咽]
我受不了！

11:20.827 --> 11:22.965
- Hey, I thought you said
you had no sense of smell?
- 嘿，我以为你说
你没有嗅觉吗？

11:23.034 --> 11:25.965
- I don't, but I can see!
- 我不知道，但我能看到！

11:26.034 --> 11:27.275
- Hmm?
- 唔？

11:27.344 --> 11:29.931
[all laughing]
[全都笑了]

11:30.000 --> 11:35.620
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:35.689 --> 11:37.379
♪ There's no stink
that ever stank so rank ♪
♪ 没有臭味
曾经如此臭名昭著♪

11:37.448 --> 11:38.931
♪ No stagnant mildew
half as dank ♪
♪ 无滞霉现象
一半潮湿♪

11:39.000 --> 11:41.137
♪ As the stinky stank
of Filthy Muck ♪
♪ 臭气熏天
肮脏的污泥♪

11:41.206 --> 11:42.758
♪ And his buddy Little Yuck ♪
♪ 还有他的好友小呸 ♪

11:42.827 --> 11:48.689
- Amazing!
- 惊人的！

11:48.758 --> 11:55.793
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪